Jenkins Migration
----------------
    - move jenkins from one server (AWS) -> another server (Azure)

    Method1:
    --------
    - install same jenkins version on new server
    - stop jenkins
    - backup existing directory:
        /var/lib/jenkins --> jenkins_backup
    - copy old server data:
        /var/lib/jenkins (old) --> new server
    - start jenkins
        results: all jobs, config restored

    Method2:
    --------
    - use Job Import Plugin
    - provide:
        source jenkins URL
        username & password
        import jobs directly
